      { id: 'p343q31', type: '阅读理解', score: 5, text: '阅读短文回答：What does David have on Mondays?', passage: 'Hello, I am David. I go to school from Monday to Friday. On Mondays, I have Chinese, English and maths. On Tuesdays, I have music and art. On Wednesdays, I have PE. On Thursdays, I have science. On Fridays, I have computer class. On weekends, I often play football and read books.', answer: 'David has Chinese, English and maths on Mondays.', explanation: '从原文"On Mondays, I have Chinese, English and maths"得知。' },
      { id: 'p343q32', type: '阅读理解', score: 5, text: '阅读短文回答：What does David do on weekends?', passage: 'Hello, I am David. I go to school from Monday to Friday. On Mondays, I have Chinese, English and maths. On Tuesdays, I have music and art. On Wednesdays, I have PE. On Thursdays, I have science. On Fridays, I have computer class. On weekends, I often play football and read books.', answer: 'He often plays football and reads books.', explanation: '从原文"On weekends, I often play football and read books"得知。' },
      { id: 'p343q33', type: '阅读理解', score: 5, text: '阅读短文判断(T/F)：David has PE on Tuesdays.', passage: 'Hello, I am David. I go to school from Monday to Friday. On Mondays, I have Chinese, English and maths. On Tuesdays, I have music and art. On Wednesdays, I have PE. On Thursdays, I have science. On Fridays, I have computer class. On weekends, I often play football and read books.', answer: 'F', explanation: '原文说"On Tuesdays, I have music and art"，PE在星期三。' },
      { id: 'p343q34', type: '阅读理解', score: 5, text: '阅读短文判断(T/F)：David goes to school on Saturdays.', passage: 'Hello, I am David. I go to school from Monday to Friday. On Mondays, I have Chinese, English and maths. On Tuesdays, I have music and art. On Wednesdays, I have PE. On Thursdays, I have science. On Fridays, I have computer class. On weekends, I often play football and read books.', answer: 'F', explanation: '原文说"I go to school from Monday to Friday"，周末不上学。' },
      { id: 'p343q35', type: '写作', score: 20, text: '请用英语介绍你的一周课程和周末活动（不少于5句话）。提示：What do you have on Mondays/Tuesdays...? What do you do on weekends?', answer: '评分标准：内容完整8分，语法正确6分，句式多样4分，书写规范2分。', explanation: '运用本单元核心句型What do you have on...? What do you do on weekends?及星期词汇Monday~Sunday、动词词组play football/read books/watch TV等。' }
