      { id: 'p344q34', type: '阅读理解', score: 5, text: '阅读短文判断(T/F)：Sarah and Tom both like ice cream.', passage: 'Hello, I am Sarah. I am hungry. I would like a hamburger and some salad for lunch. I like fruit very much. Apples are my favourite. My brother Tom would like some chicken and rice. We both like ice cream for dessert.', answer: 'T', explanation: '原文说"We both like ice cream"，判断正确。' },
      { id: 'p344q35', type: '写作', score: 20, text: '请用英语写一段话介绍你喜欢的食物和饮料（不少于5句话）。提示：What\'s your favourite food/drink? What would you like for breakfast/lunch/dinner?', answer: '评分标准：内容完整8分，语法正确6分，句式多样4分，书写规范2分。', explanation: '运用本单元核心句型What would you like to eat/drink? What\'s your favourite food?及食物饮料词汇sandwich/hamburger/salad/ice cream/tea/water等。' }
